SUMMARY:Volunteer Holiday Party with SMC
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\n**Did you 
 volunteer with the South Mountain Conservancy this year?**\n\nIf so\, we'd
  like to thank and celebrate you! As an SMC volunteer\, you're invited to 
 our annual Volunteer Holiday Party\, along with volunteers from our friend
 s at Greenwood Gardens and Cora Hartshorn Arboretum.\n\nCome toast another
  great year of caring for the Reservation with your fellow volunteers.\n\n
 *This event is for SMC volunteers\, and you're welcome to bring one guest.
 *\n\nPlease reach out to Penni Malakates ([opsdirector@somocon.org](mailto
 :opsdirector@somocon.org)) with any questions.
