SUMMARY:Hike with Dr. Kirk! 3-4 miles
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\nSunday Dec
  13\, 2-4:30 pm. Free expert-led hike in South Mountain Reservation. Hike 
 about 2-3 hours covering 3-4 miles at a modest pace over rocky trails with
  one long climb from the Rahway River up South Mountain. Focus on ecology 
 and hydrology\, led by Dr. Kirk Barrett\, President of the Rahway Watershe
 d Association and expert on local watershed issues. Good balance required.
  Children welcome. No dogs. Co-Sponsored by the South Mountain Conservancy
  and the Rahway River Watershed Association. Meet at Clipper Pavilion in S
 outh Mountain Reservation on Cherry Lane in West Orange (not at McLoone's)
 . Steady rain cancels. Email president@rahwayriver.org with questions.\n\n
 Advance registration required via [rahwayriver.org/calendar.html](rahwayri
 ver.org/calendar.html) . Email president@rahwayriver.org with questions.\n
 \n\\*\\*\\* In registering for this or any other South Mountain Conservanc
